==Faroese==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|fo}} {{term|átta|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|fo}} {{recons|ahtōu|lang=gem-pro}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|fo}} {{recons|oḱtṓw|lang=ine-pro}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ˈɔʰta]|lang=fo}}

===Number===
'''átta'''

# [[eight]], cardinal number after [[sjey]] and before [[níggju]]

[[Category:fo:Cardinal numbers]]

